209 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 167 0 R
/T (Our data was collected from Kaggle. The first table contains car prices and serves as the main table, while the second table includes car specifications. The main table consists of 558,837 records and 17 features. Examples of these features include the year, condition, selling price, and additional information such as state, location, type, and others [2]. The second table contains 1,500 records and 13 features, including model, seating capacity, rating, max power, fuel tank capacity, and other related features [3].)
/E (Our data was collected from Kaggle. The first table contains car prices and serves as the main table, while the second table includes car specifications. The main table consists of 558,837 records and 17 features. Examples of these features include the year, condition, selling price, and additional information such as state, location, type, and others [2]. The second table contains 1,500 records and 13 features, including model, seating capacity, rating, max power, fuel tank capacity, and other related features [3].)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
