/T (Loaded both tables and checked data shape, data types, and missing values. Removed unnecessary columns and handled missing values using row deletion, mode, and median replacement methods. Standardized text columns by formatting values and removing extra spaces. Converted numerical columns to the correct data types for accurate analysis. Detected and removed outliers using the IQR method to improve data quality.Saved the cleaned datasets for further analysis and visualization.)
/E (Loaded both tables and checked data shape, data types, and missing values. Removed unnecessary columns and handled missing values using row deletion, mode, and median replacement methods. Standardized text columns by formatting values and removing extra spaces. Converted numerical columns to the correct data types for accurate analysis. Detected and removed outliers using the IQR method to improve data quality.Saved the cleaned datasets for further analysis and visualization.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
