332 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 183 0 R
/T (Despite the effectiveness of the dashboard, several limitations were identified during the project.  Some car brands contained a limited number of records compared to others, which may affect the accuracy of comparisons and overall analysis.  In addition, the tables did not include important features such as fuel efficiency, accident history, or maintenance records, which could provide deeper insights into vehicle performance and pricing.  Some visualizations were also limited by the available data structure and Power BI visual settings.  Furthermore, the analysis depends on the quality and completeness of the original tables, meaning that missing or inconsistent values may influence the final insights.)
/E (Despite the effectiveness of the dashboard, several limitations were identified during the project.  Some car brands contained a limited number of records compared to others, which may affect the accuracy of comparisons and overall analysis.  In addition, the tables did not include important features such as fuel efficiency, accident history, or maintenance records, which could provide deeper insights into vehicle performance and pricing.  Some visualizations were also limited by the available data structure and Power BI visual settings.  Furthermore, the analysis depends on the quality and completeness of the original tables, meaning that missing or inconsistent values may influence the final insights.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
