/Title (In the automotive market, understanding car prices can be difficult because many factors influence their value. Many users lack simple tools to analyze car data and identify important patterns. Without clear insights into factors such as brand, model, year, and mileage, it becomes difficult to make informed decisions. In addition, the data may contain missing values and inconsistencies, which can reduce the accuracy of the analysis. This creates a need for a clear and interactive way to explore the data and support better decision-making.)
