<<
/Title (To address the challenges in understanding and analyzing car prices, this project uses Power BI to develop a clear and interactive dashboard. By presenting key factors such as brand, model, year, and mileage in visual form, users can easily explore the data and recognize patterns that affect car value. These visual insights improve the understanding of price variations and support users in making more accurate and informed decisions in the automotive market.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 923 0 R
>>
