1113 0 obj
<<
/Title (In this project, an interactive Car Market Analysis Dashboard was developed using Power BI to analyze car prices, specifications, and vehicle performance across different manufacturers. The dashboard transformed raw data into meaningful visual insights using KPI cards, charts, maps, slicers, and data modeling techniques. The analysis provided valuable insights into selling prices, horsepower, mileage, ratings, and geographical distribution of vehicles. Overall, the project demonstrates how Power BI can support data analysis and improve decision-making through effective visualization and interactive dashboard design.)
/Dest [31 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 924 0 R
>>
