1274 0 obj
<<
/Title (During the development of the dashboard, several challenges were encountered.  One of the main issues was establishing correct relationships between tables because the Car_Key column contained duplicate values, which caused many-to-many relationship problems.  To solve this issue, an additional table with unique Car_Key values was created to support proper one-to-many relationships. The project also faced data cleaning challenges, including duplicate values, missing data, and inconsistent formatting in columns such as make and model. In addition, configuring slicers and ensuring that filters interacted correctly with all visuals required multiple adjustments.  Several modifications were also needed to improve dashboard layout, alignment, colors, and overall readability. Finally, some numerical values initially appeared in incorrect formats, such as percentages instead of currency values, which required additional formatting corrections.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1268 0 R
>>
endobj
